    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dream Prison&quot; is a 3D horror escape game similar to Exit 8. Find the anomalous rooms and escape the cult church.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Game Background] </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a church, and a voice guides you to the room on the left. The path out of the church is unusually winding, but not without clues. The correct path is guarded by dream figures; find the anomalies to discover the escape route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Game Features] </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully designed anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >terrifying atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Development Team]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer: Budai</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BGM: \u201cMusic Egg\u201d Takai, Music Atelier Amacha</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Model: Bought from fab</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Effects: Found on pixabay</p>",
